-- title:
--   Binet bound from a digamma asymptotic anchor
-- statement:
--   Let $s\in\mathbb C$ satisfy $\operatorname{Re}s\ge2$, and suppose
--   $\psi(s+N)-\log(s+N)\to0$ as $N\to\infty$ through natural numbers. Then
--   $$|\psi(s)-\log s|\le\frac1{\operatorname{Re}s-1}.$$
--   Here $\psi$ is the complex digamma function and $\log$ is the principal logarithm.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/DrMurphyIsIn/Arda/blob/af4fde8972eb6d4e78c7d9a95933b18b81adf52d/telperion/examples/zero_free_bridge/lean/DlvpTheta.lean#L415-L437

